# Day 27 – Prior Authorization Story Simulator

## 📌 Project Overview

Today I built an **AI-powered Prior Authorization Story Simulator** using Claude AI.

Unlike a traditional workflow simulator, this application teaches healthcare prior authorization through **interactive storytelling, branching conversations, and real-world decision-making scenarios**.

The project demonstrates how AI can create engaging educational experiences that simplify complex healthcare processes using modern web technologies.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Interactive story-based learning
- Branching conversations
- Decision-based outcomes
- Chat-style interface
- Real-world healthcare scenarios
- Multiple story paths
- Responsive UI
- Fully browser-based application
- AI-generated using Claude AI

---

## 📖 Story Flow

1. Patient visits the doctor
2. Doctor recommends treatment
3. Insurance requires Prior Authorization
4. User chooses how to respond
5. Additional documents may be requested
6. Insurance reviews the case
7. Final approval or rejection
8. Story summary and learning outcome

